   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Civilian Crisis Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationell civil krishantering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) rekryterar, f&#xF6;rbereder,  s&#xE4;nder och st&#xF6;djer civil personal till internationella fredsinsatser som Sverige deltar i, fr&#xE4;mst insatser som leds av EU, FN eller OSSE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) recruits, prepares, deploys and supports civilian experts to international peace operations which Sweden contributes personnel to. The operations are mostly led by the UN, EU and OSCE.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International peace missions&apos; strengthened capacity to contribute to human security, rule of law and democracy, gender equality and respect for human rights</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xE4;rkt kapacitet hos centrala organisationer f&#xF6;r civil krishantering och fredsfr&#xE4;mjande att bidra till m&#xE4;nsklig s&#xE4;kerhet, r&#xE4;ttsstatlighet och demokratiska principer, j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet och respekt f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter</narrative>
  </description>
